<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" data-bs-theme="dark">

<head>
  <%- include('partials/head', {
    title: 'About - Countic',
    description: 'The story behind Countic, a Discord bot that shows YouTube, Twitch and Kick stats in voice channels.',
    canonicalPath: '/about',
  }); %>
</head>

<body id="top" class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100">

  <%- include('partials/header', { active: 'about' }); %>

  <main class="px-3">
    <div class="container col-xl-10 col-xxl-8 px-3 py-3">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-lg-5 pt-4" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="100">
        <div class="col-lg-7 text-center text-lg-start">
          <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold lh-1 mb-3">About Countic</h1>
          <p class="col-lg-10 fs-4">
            Hey, I'm <strong><a class="text-decoration-none text-white" href="https://github.com/Resad-d">@Resad</a></strong>.
            I built Countic because I couldn't find a bot that showed YouTube stats in Discord the way I wanted,
            so I wrote my own. It now tracks YouTube, Twitch and Kick for thousands of servers.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-10 mx-auto col-lg-5">
          <img src="/img/snowball.webp" width="466" height="466" alt="Resad, developer of Countic" class="rounded-circle d-block mx-auto img-fluid shadow">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container">
      <div class="col-lg-8 mx-auto">
        <section class="my-5 text-center" data-reveal>
          <p>
            Countic started as a small side project I built for myself, back when it was called YouTube Stats. It
            slowly grew into something thousands of servers use, and in <strong>2026</strong> I rewrote it from
            scratch, TypeScript, PostgreSQL, Docker, same idea, rebuilt properly. I still build it in my spare time,
            alongside other things I enjoy making. The whole codebase is
            <a href="https://github.com/Resad-d/countic" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-decoration-none text-primary-emphasis fw-bold border-bottom">open source</a>,
            and contributions are welcome.
          </p>
          <p>
            The bot outgrew free hosting a long time ago and now runs on a paid server. If you want to help with that,
            there is a
            <a href="https://www.patreon.com/c/user?u=84322514" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-decoration-none text-primary-emphasis fw-bold border-bottom">Patreon</a> page you can visit.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer'); %>
</body>

</html>
